flowchart TB
 REQ["Typed inference request<br/>purpose, work, modalities and current controls"] --> PIN["Resolve eligible persistent conversational pin<br/>or auxiliary purpose route"]
 PIN --> AVAIL{"Eligible route available?"}
 AVAIL -- Cooling --> WAIT["One durable cooldown / capacity wakeup"]
 WAIT --> PIN
 AVAIL -- Auth or unsupported --> HOLD["Actionable blocker; preserve work"]
 AVAIL -- Yes --> BUILD["Stable native history and current instructions<br/>count context; compact at required boundary"]
 BUILD --> ADMIT["Atomic current admission<br/>priced reservation or free / untracked classification"]
 ADMIT --> WIRE["Provider-specific request and ordered stream"]
 WIRE --> SAVE["Durable partial / terminal observations<br/>native continuation and usage"]
 SAVE --> CALL{"Valid complete tool calls?"}
 CALL -- Yes --> BROKER["Tool broker admission and observed results<br/>reuse recorded call identities"]
 BROKER --> BUILD
 CALL -- No --> END["Recorded turn outcome; reconcile before retry"]
